<title>QATAR: SQUASH-QATAR INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SQUASH-QATAR INTERNATIONAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DOHA 1996-10-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results in the Qatar</p>
<p>International squash tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>6-Del Harris (England) beat Jonathan Power (Canada) 15-13 15-11</p>
<p>15-4</p>
<p>2-Rodney Eyles (Australia) beat Ahmed Faizy (Egypt) 15-9 15-14</p>
<p>15-13</p>
<p>Anthony Hill (Australia) beat Zarak Jahan Khan (Pakistan) 9-15</p>
<p>15-2 15-9 15-2</p>
<p>Stephen Meads (England) beat Paul Gregory (Greece) 15-13 15-12</p>
<p>15-14</p>
<p>Zubair Jahan Khan (Pakistan) beat Byron Davis (Australia) 15-17</p>
<p>15-8 15-4 15-6</p>
<p>5-Chris Walker (England) beat Amr Shabana (Egypt) 15-11 13-15</p>
<p>15-9 15-13</p>
<p>3-Brett Martin Australia) beat Simon Frenz (Germany) - walkover</p>
<p>Jason Nicolle (England) beat Tim Garner (England) 15-13 15-9</p>
<p>15-8</p>
